"For OpenMV firmware v%(omv)s &middot; based on MicroPython v%(mpy)s &middot;"
" docs built %(date)s &middot; Copyright &copy; 2014-2026 by OpenMV, Damien "
"P. George, and others."
msgstr ""
"Для прошивки OpenMV v%(omv)s &middot; на основе MicroPython v%(mpy)s "
"&middot; документация собрана %(date)s &middot; Авторские права &copy; "
